<<set $Priya_Path = "a">>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Let's focus on intensive review sessions, Priya.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: We can quiz each other systematically and work through practice problems.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
