Raju: Intensive review will give us both the thorough preparation and confidence we need to excel.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Let's start with your most challenging subject.

<<HideAllCharacters>>
As the students commit to an intensive review strategy that emphasizes systematic practice, both understand this approach will test their dedication and persistence. The decision to focus on repetitive drilling reflects Priya's learning style preferences while offering Raju opportunities to reinforce his own understanding.

